- Cursor-aware editing.
- Undo and redo.
- Explicit precedence rules.
- Syntax diagnostics.
- Exact and approximate results where supported.

Equation solving

- Linear equations.
- Quadratic equations.
- Cubic equations where implemented and validated.
- Systems of two to four unknowns.
- Inequalities.
- Numerical root finding with convergence diagnostics.

Linear algebra

- Matrices.
- Determinants.
